  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="DA">Global Programme for Inclusive Development of Persons with Disabilities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="DA">The vision of the programme is to support and accompany 37 weak but legitimate organisations of persons with disabilities in Vietnam, Uganda, Guatemala and Bolivia in their development towards becoming strong and sustainable organisations that remain relevant to their respective members and has the capacity to create lasting improvements to the living conditions of persons with disabilities, through strong member communities as well as through enhanced capacity for advocacy, both within individual organisations as well as through coordinated efforts across partners.</narrative>
  </description>
